THIRD PARTY COMPONENTS

1. Stockfish 19 source build target - https://github.com/official-stockfish/Stockfish/tree/sf_19
   Licensed under GNU GPL version 3 or (at your option) any later version. The
   build scripts pin the official `sf_19` source tag and use the upstream script
   to fetch and hash-validate the NNUE network. See STOCKFISH.md and
   THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES/GPL-3.0.txt. The JNI integration is native/jni_bridge.cpp.
   This repair ZIP does not contain a newly built Stockfish 19 binary because
   external source/network fetches were unavailable during repair. Anyone
   distributing a compiled APK/shared library must provide the corresponding
   source for the exact engine build and modifications, preserve notices, and
   comply with GPLv3-or-later.
   Stockfish is a trademark of the Stockfish project; this app is not
   affiliated with or endorsed by it.

2. AndroidX / platform APIs - Apache License 2.0 (used only via the public
   Android SDK; no third party libraries are bundled).
